<Layout title="Affiliate disclosure — The Curated Pick">
  <article class="prose wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE TRANSPARENCY</p><h1>How our links work.</h1><p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p><p>The Curated Pick uses affiliate links. When you click a store link and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This may include Amazon, AliExpress, Alibaba, and other participating stores, depending on the links on a product page.</p><h2>Your choice of store</h2><p>You decide where to buy. We do not automatically send you to a merchant when you open a product page. Each store button names its destination. Store listings can differ in seller, variant, bundle, shipping, and return terms; please check those details before purchasing.</p><h2>Prices and availability</h2><p>We do not display live prices or claim that a store is the cheapest. Use the store buttons to view current prices and availability. Your final price, taxes, delivery charges, and any discounts are determined by that store.</p><h2>Orders and returns</h2><p>We are an independent discovery website, not a marketplace or seller. Contact the merchant directly about your order, payment, delivery, refund, warranty, or return.</p><p>For questions about this website, <a href={`mailto:${import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL || 'curatedpick.store@gmail.com'}`}>contact us by email</a>.</p></article>
</Layout>
